    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Input\nThe form collects the founder's **impact profile**. The investor list lives in a Google Sheet (tab \"investors\"), so anyone can add or remove investors without touching the workflow. The loop sends **one investor at a time** to the agent.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "dd00f20e-48f9-4d9f-926e-534ac3c21e77",
      "name": "Note dd00f2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -880,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. The AI agent\nFor each investor, Claude reads the fund's **own website** (fetch_webpage tool, max 2 pages of 4,000 characters), then returns a structured assessment: impact alignment, business fit, impact-washing check and a draft email.\n\nCost: about 16,000 tokens per investor with Haiku.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
